# 010 counter (docs/machines/010-counter/COUNTER.md): 1 MHz clock into a 20-bit counter chain
# of five 74LS161; red LED D1 sinks into C19 through R2, so it is lit while C19 is low.

part X1 OSC freq=1MHz
part J1 POWER
part R1 R value=4k7
part R2 R value=330
part U1 74LS161
part U2 74LS161
part U3 74LS161
part U4 74LS161
part U5 74LS161
part D1 LED

net CLK      X1.OUT U1.CLK U2.CLK U3.CLK U4.CLK U5.CLK
net RESET_N  R1.2 U1.CLR_N U2.CLR_N U3.CLR_N U4.CLR_N U5.CLR_N
net VCC      R1.1 R2.1

# Every counter always counts and never loads; U1 is the low nibble, enabled for good.
net VCC      U1.ENP U1.LOAD_N U2.ENP U2.LOAD_N U3.ENP U3.LOAD_N U4.ENP U4.LOAD_N U5.ENP U5.LOAD_N
net VCC      U1.ENT
net GND      U1.A U1.B U1.C U1.D U2.A U2.B U2.C U2.D U3.A U3.B U3.C U3.D
net GND      U4.A U4.B U4.C U4.D U5.A U5.B U5.C U5.D

net C0       U1.QA
net C1       U1.QB
net C2       U1.QC
net C3       U1.QD
net CARRY1   U1.RCO U2.ENT
net C4       U2.QA
net C5       U2.QB
net C6       U2.QC
net C7       U2.QD
net CARRY2   U2.RCO U3.ENT
net C8       U3.QA
net C9       U3.QB
net C10      U3.QC
net C11      U3.QD
net CARRY3   U3.RCO U4.ENT
net C12      U4.QA
net C13      U4.QB
net C14      U4.QC
net C15      U4.QD
net CARRY4   U4.RCO U5.ENT
net C16      U5.QA
net C17      U5.QB
net C18      U5.QC
net C19      U5.QD D1.K

# LED: +5 V through R2 into the anode; the cathode sinks into C19.
net LED_A    R2.2 D1.A
